+"Premium cinematic 3D infographic-style render of [concept e.g. Starlight Agent Hierarchy with central Queen conductor], layered luminous orbs and agent nodes connected by fine glowing threads, [specific Queen + swarms or chibi agents integrated elegantly], deep cosmic #060609 background with violet cyan glass materials, volumetric light, clean modern data visualization aesthetic that feels alive and intelligent, high detail, sophisticated, 16:9 or vertical 9:16, Starlight Intelligence DNA."
