+- ${industry === 'Legal' ? 'Legal Sentinel' : 'Industry Specialist'}
+
+## Configuration
+- Supabase RLS: Enabled
+- Headroom Proxy: Active
+- Data Sync: Local-only SQLite Memory Bus
+`;
